  "$comment": "One source for the build (scripts/build.mjs) and the Worker (src/worker.js). stores: the GitHub repositories whose releases carry latest.json and latest-android.json, read in this order; the Worker and the build take the newest. releasePage: where people find every release, and where /download/<platform> sends them when no store answers. origin: the one address the site shows; the Worker sends redirectHosts there with a 301.",
